addon-image-layouts"><div class="sppb-addon-content"><div class="sppb-addon-image-layout-wrap image-layout-preset-style-stack"><div class="sppb-addon-image-layout-image image-fit sppb-order-1 sppb-order-lg- sppb-order-md- sppb-order-sm- sppb-order-xs-"><a href="/media/attachments/2025/11/03/agenda-digital-2025.pdf" target="_blank" rel="nofollow"><img class="sppb-img-responsive image-fit" src="https://oficialiamayor.sonora.gob.mx/images/2026/05/12/150236.jpg" alt="Ver informe" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy"></a></div><div class="sppb-addon-image-layout-content sppb-order-1 sppb-order-lg- sppb-order-md- sppb-order-sm- sppb-order-xs- sppb-text-alignment"><h4 class="sppb-image-layout-title">AGENDA<br /><strong> DIGITAL 2025</strong></h4><div class="sppb-addon-image-layout-text"><p>La Ley de Gobierno Digital establece la elaboración de la Agenda Digital como instrumento de planeación mediante el cual se programen compromisos a corto plazo, para el cumplimiento del Programa Especial de Gobierno Digital.</p></div><a href="/media/attachments/2025/11/03/agenda-digital-2025.pdf" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" id="btn-2085809e-8e34-4cac-8b61-f213e1c7fe95" class="sppb-btn  sppb-btn-primary sppb-btn-round sppb-btn-block" role="button" aria-label="Ver documento"><i class="far fa-file-lines" aria-hidden="true"></i> Ver documento</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sppb-row-column  " id="column-wrap-id-d360dca3-0648-446b-95c1-ecfcc0e28bb5"><div id="column-id-d360dca3-0648-446b-95c1-ecfcc0e28bb5" class="sppb-column " ><div class="sppb-column-addons"><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-da2bba6c-b8aa-4628-9c50-efbdc3c9d4fd" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-image-layouts" ><div id="sppb-addon-da2bba6c-b8aa-4628-9c50-efbdc3c9d4fd" class="clearfix  " ><div class="sppb-addon-image-layouts"><div class="sppb-addon-content"><div class="sppb-addon-image-layout-wrap image-layout-preset-style-stack"><div class="sppb-addon-image-layout-image image-fit sppb-order-1 sppb-order-lg- sppb-order-md- sppb-order-sm- sppb-order-xs-"><a href="/media/attachments/2026/04/16/agenda-digital-2026.pdf" target="_blank" rel="nofollow"><img class="sppb-img-responsive image-fit" src="https://oficialiamayor.sonora.gob.mx/images/2025/10/16/668.jpg" alt="Ver informe" width="1000" height="668" loading="lazy"></a></div><div class="sppb-addon-image-layout-content sppb-order-1 sppb-order-lg- sppb-order-md- sppb-order-sm- sppb-order-xs- sppb-text-alignment"><h4 class="sppb-image-layout-title">AGENDA<br /><strong> DIGITAL 2026</strong></h4><div class="sppb-addon-image-layout-text"><p>La Agenda Digital 2026 del Gobierno del Estado de Sonora se construye como un instrumento de planeación estratégica que da continuidad y profundiza los avances alcanzados durante la ejecución de la Agenda Digital 2025</p></div><a href="/media/attachments/2026/04/16/agenda-digital-2026.pdf" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" id="btn-da2bba6c-b8aa-4628-9c50-efbdc3c9d4fd" class="sppb-btn  sppb-btn-primary sppb-btn-round sppb-btn-block" role="button"><i class="far fa-file-lines" aria-hidden="true"></i> Ver documento</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sppb-row-column  " id="column-wrap-id-8d41c4c3-fed1-46fd-8c21-3f359242a82e"><div id="column-id-8d41c4c3-fed1-46fd-8c21-3f359242a82e" class="sppb-column " ><div class="sppb-column-addons"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section-id-abf2ac66-c507-4fed-b9ae-0c9338ebd099" class="sppb-section" ><div class="sppb-row-container"><div class="sppb-row"><div class="sppb-row-column  " id="column-wrap-id-c15f64b2-21c3-4048-a731-9a7493293863"><div id="column-id-c15f64b2-21c3-4048-a731-9a7493293863" class="sppb-column " ><div class="sppb-column-addons"><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-6642d893-0dea-41d1-8d20-40ab21381865" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-module" ><div id="sppb-addon-6642d893-0dea-41d1-8d20-40ab21381865" class="clearfix  " ><div class